---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy | MAME Capital">
  <main class="legal">
    <div class="wrap">
      <a class="back" href="/"><img src="/images/mame-logo-on-dark.svg?v=8" alt="MAME Capital home" width="174" height="42" /></a>
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="updated">Last updated: 15 October 2026</p>

      <p>This privacy policy describes how MAME Capital GmbH collects, uses, and protects personal data processed through the website www.mamecapital.com (hereinafter referred to as the “Site”), in accordance with the Swiss Federal Act on Data Protection (nFADP) and, where applicable, the EU General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR).</p>

      <h2>Data Controller</h2>
      <p>
        MAME Capital GmbH<br />
        Bahnhofstrasse 10, 8001 Zürich, Switzerland<br />
        Email: <a href="mailto:info@mamecapital.com">info@mamecapital.com</a>
      </p>

      <h2>Categories of Personal Data Processed</h2>
      <p>We may collect and process the following data:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Identification data: first name, last name, company name</li>
        <li>Contact data: email address, phone number</li>
        <li>Usage data: IP address, browser type, pages visited, access times</li>
        <li>Other information you voluntarily provide when contacting us by email or phone</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Purpose of Data Processing</h2>
      <p>Personal data is processed for the following purposes:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Responding to enquiries sent to us by email or phone</li>
        <li>Following up on introduction requests</li>
        <li>Ensuring proper technical operation of the Site</li>
        <li>Complying with legal obligations, if applicable</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Legal Basis for Processing</h2>
      <p>Under the nFADP, data is processed on the basis of:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>The user’s consent, where required</li>
        <li>The performance of a contract or pre-contractual measures</li>
        <li>Overriding legitimate interests of the data controller (e.g. security and technical operation of the Site)</li>
      </ul>
      <p>For users located in the EU, processing is also carried out according to the legal bases established by the GDPR.</p>

      <h2>Data Recipients</h2>
      <p>Personal data may be disclosed to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>IT service providers, cloud providers, and hosting companies</li>
        <li>Collaborators and contractual partners</li>
        <li>Public authorities, if required by law</li>
      </ul>
      <p>We do not sell or disclose personal data to third parties for commercial purposes.</p>

      <h2>Data Transfers Abroad</h2>
      <p>We may transfer personal data to service providers located outside of Switzerland or the EU only where the destination country ensures an adequate level of data protection, or where appropriate safeguards (e.g. EU Standard Contractual Clauses) are in place. The Site is hosted by Cloudflare, Inc., and our email is provided by Google; both may process data in the United States under such safeguards.</p>

      <h2>Data Security</h2>
      <p>We implement technical and organizational security measures to protect personal data against unauthorized access, loss, misuse, or disclosure.</p>

      <h2>Data Retention</h2>
      <p>Personal data is retained only for as long as necessary to fulfill the purposes for which it was collected or to comply with legal obligations.</p>

      <h2>User Rights</h2>
      <p>Under the Swiss nFADP and, where applicable, the EU GDPR, users have the right to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Access their personal data</li>
        <li>Request rectification or erasure</li>
        <li>Restrict or object to processing</li>
        <li>Request data portability</li>
        <li>Withdraw consent at any time</li>
        <li>Lodge a complaint with the Swiss Federal Data Protection and Information Commissioner (FDPIC) or a relevant EU supervisory authority</li>
      </ul>
      <p>To exercise these rights, users can contact: <a href="mailto:privacy@mamecapital.com">privacy@mamecapital.com</a></p>

      <h2>Cookies and Similar Technologies</h2>
      <p>This Site does not use cookies for analytics, advertising or profiling. Our hosting provider may set strictly necessary technical cookies for security purposes; these do not identify you personally.</p>

      <h2>Changes to This Privacy Policy</h2>
      <p>We reserve the right to update this privacy policy at any time. In case of material changes, we will notify users via the Site or, where applicable, by email.</p>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .legal {
    min-height: 100vh;
    background: #262a36;
    color: #e4e0db;
    font-family: 'Instrument Sans', system-ui, sans-serif;
  }

  .wrap {
    max-width: 1280px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 64px 32px 144px;
  }

  .back {
    display: inline-block;
  }

  .back img {
    display: block;
    height: 42px;
    width: auto;
  }

  h1 {
    margin: 80px 0 16px;
    font-family: 'Newsreader', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 64px;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.05;
  }

  h2 {
    margin: 48px 0 0;
    font-family: 'Newsreader', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 28px;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .updated {
    margin-bottom: 32px;
    color: #8f8a87;
    font-size: 15px;
  }

  p,
  ul {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 14px 0 0;
    color: #b8b3b0;
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  ul {
    padding-left: 20px;
  }

  li + li {
    margin-top: 6px;
  }

  li::marker {
    color: #b3a265;
  }

  a {
    color: #e4e0db;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  p a:hover {
    color: #b3a265;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .wrap {
      padding-right: 16px;
      padding-left: 16px;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: 48px;
    }
  }
</style>
